        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 451211, Denver Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Two Piece Denver Sandcast Bronze Handleset has an arched design that makes it a classic for traditional decors. It is this old world style, when paired with the rustic sandcast bronze material, that makes the Denver Entrance Handleset with Covered Deadbolt great for historic homes. The Denver Handleset is available in either single or dummy functions. It will fit either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 2-7/8 inches thick. This rustic handleset is available in 3 beautiful finishes: flat black bronze, medium bronze, and white bronze. This traditional handleset made by Emtek is available with your choice of interior trim lever or knob for a truly personal look.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSandcasting is a process for casting metal in sand molds. The mold is made by packing the sand around a pattern. Molten bronze is then poured into a mold cavity formed out of sand. Each sand mold is used only once. The sand is then recycled for the next piece.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Sandcast Bronze Denver Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li> \r\n<li>UL 180 minute fire rating</li>\r\n<li>Hardened steel bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Denver Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Height: 4-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Plate Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Height: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-7/8\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 6-7/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-450211-specifications.pdf?v=1704262355\"><b>Emtek 451211 Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Handle-A-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262355\"><b>Emtek Tubular Entryset Template Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy Set:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the handleset latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the inside, a thumbturn unlocks the deadbolt and a knob/lever operates the latch.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
